    "text": "travelbinger.com\nwebsite\nBowling Green\nFrom Burnouts to Off-Road Action, LS Fest East 2025 Turns Bowling Green, KY Into a Car Lover’s Destination\nBy Travelbinger,\n12 hours agoFor travelers looking for a unique getaway, Bowling Green, Kentucky, offers more than just Southern charm; it’s a city that pulses with automotive passion. Each September, visitors from around the world descend on Beech Bend Raceway Park to witness LS Fest East, a celebration that has become a must-attend event for car enthusiasts.",
